The function is already minimal; I cached the `type` member in a local and added branch-prediction hints to help the common path avoid reloads and mispredictions.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    const FIT_UINT8 t = type;
    if (__builtin_expect(t != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1))
        return t;

    if (__builtin_expect(profile == NULL, 0) || profileIndex >= profile->numFields)
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
```